Package: ggstackedsurv
Title: Stacked Probability Plots for Multi-State Survival Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Alexandre", "Bohyn", email = "alexandre.bohyn@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Facilitate the creation of stacked probability plots for multi-state survival models with `ggplot2`. Each function from the package creates a proper `ggplot2` object that can be modified with any function from the `ggplot2` or any of its extensions.
